# Commit and push the full working tree

When Ross asks to commit and/or push:

- Stage **all** changes since the last commit: modified, added, and deleted project files, including untracked source.
- Do not leave related work out, and do not ask which files to include.
- Still skip secrets (`.env`, credentials, `secrets.json`) and machine-only junk (`node_modules`, `dist`, build dirs).
- Write a subject and a short body that explain why.
- Push after the commit when he asked to push, or when he asked to commit and push.
- Do not commit or push unless he asked.
